<h1 class="govuk-heading-l">
  You need to update your details before you submit a claim
</h1>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">
  Update your teaching details
</h2>

<p class="govuk-body">
Use the <%= govuk_link_to "access your teaching qualifications", "https://www.gov.uk/guidance/access-your-teaching-qualifications" %> service to update your details.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  Once your details have been updated, you can restart your claim.
</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-m">
  Update your qualification details
</h2>

<p class="govuk-body">
If your teacher training or qualified teacher status (QTS) details are incorrect, email us directly at <%= govuk_mail_to "teaching.status@education.gov.uk", "teaching.status@education.gov.uk" %>.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  If your first degree details are incorrect, contact the education provider where you studied and ask them to update their records with DfE.
</p>
